{"id":"vod_hh_31163","vodId":"31163","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"轻音少女 第二季","name_cn":"轻音少女 第二季","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第27集","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/d805b3977c018e4f8d30c5e6b0e59b42.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在樱丘高中，围绕着由五个成员组成的轻音部展开。这支名为“放学后茶会”的乐队中，担任吉他和主唱的是天然呆少女平沢唯（丰崎爱生 配音），担任贝斯手的是稳重但容易害羞的秋山澪（日笠阳子 配音），担任鼓手的部长，是非常有活力的田井中律（佐藤聪美 配音），温柔热情的键盘手是琴吹紬（寿美菜子 配音），吉他手是学妹中野梓（竹达彩奈 配音）。新学年开始，除了小梓，大家都升上三年级，还被分到了同一个班级。然而要是再不招揽新成员入部，来年四名成员毕业离校，轻音部就要面临废部的命运了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-05-30 17:01:51","playable":true,"episodeCount":27,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aK94Kxd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YerVOype/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/yb8K4wja/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lej6DGye/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepLMrQe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/qaQg4Z9d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/RdGW4yJd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aMW4OGd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/pen6Kn7e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/7axLXOBa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nelEGjMa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nelEGKja/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Ddw7WMrd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lej6D7ve/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YaO64Vre/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9b6KZrOd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/5eVn68ze/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"ht